&lt;li&gt;Have at least&lt;strong&gt; 7 years&lt;/strong&gt; of successful &lt;strong&gt;B2B &lt;/strong&gt;experience selling large, complex enterprise-grade solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong network &amp;amp; understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;UK insurance ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling &lt;strong&gt;SaaS solutions&lt;/strong&gt; would be preferred;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of new business sales and evidence of winning and developing new accounts; selling of $300K and above across a multiyear contract;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are at ease with, building/qualifying/closing own sales pipelines and mobilizing internal resources to support ongoing customer opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive working in a fast pace environment and demonstrate a competitive, positive, winning attitude;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a solid understanding of demand creation, and a keen ability of negotiation skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can tailor communication to the customer’s needs with confidence, and can effectively deliver memorable presentations leveraging storytelling skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a strategic thinker to systematically solve problems and hypothesize possible pain points and implicit needs;&lt;/li&gt;
